function openCrewUpdate(id){const d=getDay(selectedDate,true),s=getSession(d,id);if(!s)return;const time=safeActionTime(s),current=crewAt(s,time);(sheet.innerHTML=`<div class="sheet"><div class="sheet-head"><div><h2>Atualizar equipe</h2><div class="meta">A equipe anterior permanece no histórico.</div></div><button class="close">×</button></div><div class="form"><label>Horário<input id="crewTime" type="time" value="${time}"></label><div><div class="form-label">Funcionários a partir deste horário</div><div id="crewUpdateList">${employeeChecks(current)}</div></div></div><button class="btn" id="saveCrewUpdate">Salvar equipe</button></div>`, document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('field:sheet-rendered')));sheet.showModal();sheet.querySelector('.close').addEventListener('click',()=>sheet.close());$('#saveCrewUpdate').addEventListener('click',async()=>{const ids=[...sheet.querySelectorAll('#crewUpdateList input:checked')].map(i=>i.value),t=$('#crewTime').value;if(!ids.length)return show('Selecione ao menos 1 funcionário.');if(timeMinutes(t)===null)return show('Informe um horário válido.');s.crewEvents.push({time:t,employeeIds:ids});s.crewEvents.sort((a,b)=>timeMinutes(a.time)-timeMinutes(b.time));s.updatedAt=new Date().toISOString();await save();sheet.close();renderDay();show('Equipe da sessão atualizada.')})}
